]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["這家位於林森北路的麵屋千雲，營業時間很晚，是很多人吃宵夜的選擇。就餐點本身來說，味道還算是不錯的。沾麵的沾醬不是那種特別濃稠的日式風格，稍微有點稀，但口味調配得宜，點大份的麵量非常足夠，男生絕對吃得飽。另一碗柚子香氣的雞白湯拉麵表現更佳，細麵口感不錯，柚子的香味讓整碗雞湯喝起來不那麼油膩，算是蠻有水準的拉麵。\n不過，這次的用餐體驗有一個非常糟糕的結尾。當天因為參與打卡活動，店家送了一份雞肉的小菜，結果吃完回家後，我竟然出現了嚴重的拉肚子反應。雖然無法絕對證明是那盤小菜引起的問題，但時間點的巧合確實讓人對食品衛生感到擔憂。優點是拉麵份量足、宵夜方便；缺點則是可能存在的食安隱患。建議大家來用餐時，腸胃比較敏感的話要稍微留意一下。\n\nMenya Senun, located on Linsen North Road, is a popular late-night spot for ramen lovers. Regarding the food itself, the taste is actually quite decent. The tsukemen (dipping noodles) has a sauce that isn't as thick as traditional Japanese styles—it's a bit on the thin side—but the flavor profile is well-balanced. The large portion is incredibly generous and will definitely fill you up. The Yuzu Chicken Broth Ramen was even better; the thin noodles had a great texture, and the refreshing yuzu scent perfectly cut through the richness of the chicken broth, making it a very enjoyable bowl.\nHowever, this dining experience had a terrible aftermath. Because of a social media check-in promotion, we received a complimentary chicken side dish. Unfortunately, shortly after returning home, I suffered from a severe case of diarrhea. While I cannot be 100% certain that the free chicken dish was the culprit, the timing is highly suspicious and raises significant concerns about food safety and hygiene. Pros: great portion sizes and convenient late-night hours. Cons: a massive potential food safety issue. If you have a sensitive stomach, I strongly advise being cautious when dining here.",null,[0,155]]]],[null,1778428452000000,1778428452000000,"3 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfTjBrbkpPSTNpX3ZVRUowMmM2Q0Z2dw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiLwoZQ0hfTjBrbkpPSTNpX3ZVRUowMmM2Q0Z2dxoSQ2dzSXBOU0MwQVlRaGRERVNR\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjq_9KH8tSWAxXmZ_UHHQBGG5gQ_2MIlQEoFg"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1585432581869657726/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhWTUZSdVozcGhTR2hwVW1wb01WRXpRWGhsUnpoM1RGVlJNVmt6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1585432581869657726/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhWTUZSdVozcGhTR2hwVW1wb01WRXpRWGhsUnpoM1RGVlJNVmt6WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1585432581869657726/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhWTUZSdVozcGhTR2hwVW1wb01WRXpRWGhsUnpoM1RGVlJNVmt6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1585432581869657726/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhWTUZSdVozcGhTR2hwVW1wb01WRXpRWGhsUnpoM1RGVlJNVmt6WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1585432581869657726/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhWTUZSdVozcGhTR2hwVW1wb01WRXpRWGhsUnpoM1RGVlJNVmt6WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1585432581869657726/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnhWTUZSdVozcGhTR2hwVW1wb01WRXpRWGhsUnpoM1RGVlJNVmt6WXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["感謝您的肯定與提醒。\n您提及的狀況我們會特別重視，並再次檢視餐點與作業流程，持續努力提供更安心的用餐體驗，謝謝您的回饋。",null,[0,60]]]],[null,null,21415,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xVMFRuZ3phSGhpUmpoMVEzQXhlRzh3TFVRMVkzYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x532d9321d5a305f0!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOlU0TngzaHhiRjh1Q3AxeG8wLUQ1Y3c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xVMFRuZ3phSGhpUmpoMVEzQXhlRzh3TFVRMVkzYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xVMFRuZ3phSGhpUmpoMVEzQXhlRzh3TFVRMVkzYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xVMFRuZ3phSGhpUmpoMVEzQXhlRzh3TFVRMVkzYxILMGR2RUJvNnp4bUsaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09sVTBUbmd6YUhoaVJqaDFRM0F4ZUc4d0xVUTFZM2MSCzBkdkVCbzZ6eG1LIhIJAAAAAAAAAAAR8AWj1SGTLVMqCzBkdkVCbzZ6eG1L\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjq_9KH8tSWAxXmZ_UHHQBGG5gQoykIlgEoFw"],null,[null,[[1,0]]